# Regenerable inputs to the oracle: hundreds of MB of .npy logits, produced
# from fixtures and a model that live outside this repository. The reference
# JSON they produce is committed; these are not.
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Fetched at a pinned commit by scripts/fetch-kenlm.sh, not vendored.
third_party/
dist/

# Built libraries copied into the package directory when building a wheel.
#
# The wheel build stages them here on purpose — the binding looks for its
# library in its own directory first — but they are build outputs and must
# never be committed. Without this rule a `git add -A` after a local wheel
# build puts a few hundred KB of binary in the repo, and the same class of
# mistake already cost this project a several-hundred-megabyte history once.
python/ctc_beam_decoder/*.so
python/ctc_beam_decoder/*.dylib
python/ctc_beam_decoder/*.dll
